speechtext:
The National Harbours Board advises as follows: 1. (1) Mr. H. A. Mann, Chairman;
(2)	Mr. L. R. Talbot, Eng., Vice-Chairman;
(3)	Mr. E. J. Alton, Member; (4) Mr. J. E. Lloyd, C.A., Member.
2. (1) Executive Manager, Maritimes Transportation Commission; (2) President, Rene Talbot Ltd., Quebec; (3) Executive, Buckers-fields Ltd., Vancouver; (4) Practicing Chartered Accountant, Halifax.
